From: Mohtashim <mohtashim9119@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 01:35:15 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ws3): add WebGL2 export failure diagnosis module

Pure injectable probe that returns stable reason codes and renderer identity when the export gate's WebGL2 clause fails, with headless fakes for every branch.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
---
